  "question": {
    "text": "The enthalpy of combustion of propane, graphite and dihydrogen at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> are: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2220</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> respectively. The magnitude enthalpy of formation of propane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (Nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "104",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The combustion reaction can be written as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2220</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>graphite</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now, the formation reaction of propane is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mi>graphite</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>graphite</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>propane</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2220</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>103</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
